    "demo_store.scrub_costs().",
    "",
    "Share tokens are fixed rather than random so the customer link stays the",
    "same across restarts: a demo where the link you just pasted into a text",
    "message has stopped working is worse than a predictable token on data",
    "that is fictional anyway."
